# Error Messages

error-accessToken = Authentication required. Please log in again.
error-unauthorized = You are not authorized to perform this action.
error-forbidden = Access denied. You don't have permission to access this resource.
error-notFound = The requested resource was not found.
error-serverError = Server error occurred. Please try again later or contact support.
error-networkError = Network connection failed. Please check your internet connection and try again.
error-graphqlError = An error occurred while processing your request. Please try again.
error-restError = Request failed. Please try again later.
error-unknown = An unexpected error occurred. Please try again.



